# Store every text file with LF line endings, also when it is written on Windows.
# Why: CI runs on Linux, and Prettier is set to LF. Without this, Git on Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true) would check files out with CRLF and every file would look changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.avif binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
